"doc/basics.md","read_id":"9e25540615346d4feff76afa3ceacf6efbf971ec08721f800cffb4ca721c4731","retrieval_handle":"observed-read:9e25540615346d4feff76afa3ceacf6efbf971ec08721f800cffb4ca721c4731","source_revision":"base","source_sha256":"aa2bee6ce5e17990204c3dc01f76a9237237836d885f939c1d159e7744e4813c","start_line":773,"total_lines":1972,"utf8":"The simdjson library also supports [JSON pointer](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6901) through the `at_pointer()` method, letting you reach further down into the document in a single call. JSON pointer is supported by both the [DOM approach](https://github.com/simdjson/simdjson/blob/master/doc/dom.md#json-pointer) as well as the On Demand approach."},{"base_commit":"c5c43e9c7ff613bf01ca14b9b9083d38a6efd5fc","byte_count":41,"end_line":1,"path":"doc/dom.md","read_id":"8b8879ef1c7536701bda15b70ebf3128bb66507bb4d7f28c6c2cfbc5a71810a6","retrieval_handle":"observed-read:8b8879ef1c7536701bda15b70ebf3128bb66507bb4d7f28c6c2cfbc5a71810a6","source_revision":"base","source_sha256":"4524a04469a0fce6db04218654f9417af1ad3e9c245529ba5d0ddab8d2fe9c6d","start_line":1,"total_lines":667,"utf8":"The Document-Object-Model (DOM) front-end"},{"base_commit":"c5c43e9c7ff613bf01ca14b9b9083d38a6efd5fc","byte_count":39,"end_line":6,"path":"doc/dom.md","read_id":"827da21bb51a87b6247b1f460c380d99e759aafd4426d6f1debc1d97cdc4893d","retrieval_handle":"observed-read:827da21bb51a87b6247b1f460c380d99e759aafd4426d6f1debc1d97cdc4893d","source_revision":"base","source_sha256":"4524a04469a0fce6db04218654f9417af1ad3e9c245529ba5d0ddab8d2fe9c6d","start_line":6,"total_lines":667,"utf8":"* [DOM vs On Demand](#dom-vs-on-demand)"},{"base_commit":"c5c43e9c7ff613bf01ca14b9b9083d38a6efd5fc","byte_count":53,"end_line":17,"path":"doc/dom.md","read_id":"71800b5ead10fd8c858102ca625ebb7f196fcf3813237de79af4dd5d1a654445","retrieval_handle":"observed-read:71800b5ead10fd8c858102ca625ebb7f196fcf3813237de79af4dd5d1a654445","source_revision":"base","source_sha256":"4524a04469a0fce6db04218